L["A unified replacement for the Blizzard quest experience: a custom tracker, objective markers on the map and minimap, nameplate quest icons, and a browser for the quests you have not picked up yet."] = "一套完整替代暴雪任務體驗的工具：自訂追蹤器、世界地圖與小地圖上的目標標記、姓名板任務圖示，以及尚未接取任務的瀏覽器。"
L["A unified replacement for the Blizzard quest experience: a custom tracker, world-map overlays, quest history, and a Midnight chain guide."] = "一套完整替代暴雪任務體驗的工具：自訂追蹤器、世界地圖覆蓋層、任務歷史記錄以及午夜版本任務鏈指南。"
