L["An on-screen panel while inside a delve showing the story variant and its grade, the recommended curios for your role, your run timer, and your death count."] = "在探究中的畫面面板，顯示劇情變體及其評級、適合你職責的建議珍奇物品、計時器和死亡次數。"
